{"id":"74d22101be46c0e1","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CombCompileRow.md","title":"CombCompileRow","display":"CombCompileRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"CombCompileRow","parameters":["z2207","z2208","z2209"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"CombCompileRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>z2207</span><span>z2208</span><span>z2209</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：System F 固定组合代数与 PER 语义。有序参数：<code>z2207</code>、<code>z2208</code>、<code>z2209</code>。</p>\n<p>先编译 λ 体，再以具体括号抽象消去绑定。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ CombCompileRow z2207 z2208 z2209)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists t\n  (exists u\n    (and\n      (@ Pair t u z2209)\n      (and\n        (@ URaw t)\n        (and\n          (@ CombRaw u)\n          (or\n            (exists z2212 (and (@ TVar z2212 t) (= t u)))\n            (or\n              (exists z2213\n                (exists z2214\n                  (exists z2215\n                    (exists z2216\n                      (and\n                        (@ TApp z2213 z2214 t)\n                        (and\n                          (@ TApp z2215 z2216 u)\n                          (and\n                            (exists z2217\n                            (exists z2218 (and (in z2217 z2208) (and (@ App z2207 z2217 z2218) (@ Pair z2213 z2215 z2218)))))\n                            (exists z2219\n                            (exists z2220 (and (in z2219 z2208) (and (@ App z2207 z2219 z2220) (@ Pair z2214 z2216 z2220))))))))))))\n              (exists z2213\n                (exists z2214\n                  (and\n                    (@ ULam z2213 t)\n                    (and\n                      (exists z2221\n                        (exists z2222 (and (in z2221 z2208) (and (@ App z2207 z2221 z2222) (@ Pair z2213 z2214 z2222)))))\n                      (@ CombAbstract z2214 u))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"316e4260b85137de\" href=\"?note=316e4260b85137de\" title=\"ZFC_CombAbstract\">CombAbstract</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0013cbf190631960\" href=\"?note=0013cbf190631960\" title=\"ZFC_CombRaw\">CombRaw</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8ee8586c4703b19e\" href=\"?note=8ee8586c4703b19e\" title=\"ZFC_TApp\">TApp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"00213bb93d499434\" href=\"?note=00213bb93d499434\" title=\"ZFC_TVar\">TVar</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f077e9016ad9f66b\" href=\"?note=f077e9016ad9f66b\" title=\"ZFC_ULam\">ULam</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fad087c9d77463a6\" href=\"?note=fad087c9d77463a6\" title=\"ZFC_URaw\">URaw</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文